  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CONSTRUCTION OF PRIMARY SCHOOLS AND MADRASAHS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE PROJECT AIMS AT CONSTRUCTING 500 PRIMARY SCHOOLS AND 200 MADRASAHS IN MAINLY RURAL AREAS OF BANGLADESH. THE PROJECT WILL REDUCE THE INEQUITABLE ACCESS TO PRIMARY EDUCATION ESPECIALLY FOR THE RURAL AREAS AND FOR THOSE CHILDREN WHOSE PARENTS PREFER TO SEND THEM TO MADRASAHS EDUCATION SYSTEM ONLY. IT WILL HELP THE GOB EFFORTS IN THE ERADICATION OF ILLITERACY BY THE YEAR 2000.</narrative>
  </description>
